  "transcript_hash": "c7e956a4b05fc77d195b370bd4082257fb34b2e1e5ae25504373c9d0baefbc8d",
  "inputs": [
   {
    "text": "OK, next point: the laptops for the sales team. Ryan, can you give us an update?",
    "voice_id": "BIvP0GN1cAtSRTxNHnWS",
    "speaker": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "Sure. The supplier called me this morning. The delivery is now on Wednesday, not Thursday.",
    "voice_id": "sfJopaWaOtauCD3HKX6Q",
    "speaker": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "Sorry, did you say Wednesday?",
    "voice_id": "BIvP0GN1cAtSRTxNHnWS",
    "speaker": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "Yes, Wednesday. One day earlier. But the laptops arrive in the afternoon, after four.",
    "voice_id": "sfJopaWaOtauCD3HKX6Q",
    "speaker": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "Just to check, do the laptops come with the new system, or do we need to install it?",
    "voice_id": "Ha9f2JUQ4LL1bw2ZcNjS",
    "speaker": 2
   },
   {
    "text": "We need to install it. That's the problem.",
    "voice_id": "sfJopaWaOtauCD3HKX6Q",
    "speaker": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "OK. How long does it take?",
    "voice_id": "Ha9f2JUQ4LL1bw2ZcNjS",
    "speaker": 2
   },
   {
    "text": "About two hours for all twenty laptops.",
    "voice_id": "sfJopaWaOtauCD3HKX6Q",
    "speaker": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "So the laptops can be ready on Thursday morning, right?",
    "voice_id": "BIvP0GN1cAtSRTxNHnWS",
    "speaker": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "Yes, if I start on Wednesday evening.",
    "voice_id": "Ha9f2JUQ4LL1bw2ZcNjS",
    "speaker": 2
   },
   {
    "text": "Great. Then we keep the training on Tuesday with the old laptops, and the team gets the new ones on Thursday. Ryan, can you tell the trainer?",
    "voice_id": "BIvP0GN1cAtSRTxNHnWS",
    "speaker": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "Sure. I'll email her today.",
    "voice_id": "sfJopaWaOtauCD3HKX6Q",
    "speaker": 1
   }
  ],
